            <ArticleTitle>Pulmonary embolism presenting as acute abdominal pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>318-20</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pulmonary embolism has protean manifestations. This report describes a 20-year-old woman without risk factors with pulmonary embolism presenting as abdominal pain. Previous cases and potential etiologies of pain are reviewed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
